writer2: 14 and 15 build, and their "Something to try" now prints as the Try this card. On paths: the build places a drawing in one of two ways. Either the Figure line names its path (a lab/... .svg or a cleared screenshot), or the designer's list maps it. A path on a %% line is never read. So 12's line of time is simply gone from the print, which is what you meant. A figure you want placed needs its path on the Figure line or in the designer's list.

